{"id": "t009-002", "text": "Khadija told me at lunch that she's pregnant! Due in early March. She's been really sick in the mornings and is exhausted, poor thing.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Khadija", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pregnant", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Due", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in early March", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sick in the mornings", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "exhausted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t009-003", "text": "Caroline and Graham have invited us to their 25th anniversary dinner on the 3rd of August. Smart dress, apparently.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Caroline", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Graham", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "25th anniversary dinner", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 3rd of August", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t009-009", "text": "Had coffee with Abebe. His wife Selam is expecting their second in November, and he's quietly panicking about space in the flat. They're looking at three-beds in Walthamstow but nothing's come up yet. Don't forget to send him that link to the house on Elm Road.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Abebe", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Selam", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "expecting", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in November", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "quietly panicking", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "looking at three-beds in Walthamstow", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send him that link to the house on Elm Road", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "send", "timing": "unspecified"}]}
{"id": "t009-010", "text": "Kavya's christening for little Arjun is on Sunday 22nd September at St Mary's, lunch afterwards at her mum's. I'm doing a salad for it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kavya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "christening", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Arjun", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday 22nd September", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "lunch", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t009-012", "text": "Rohan's 40th is next Friday at the Crown, upstairs room from 7. His partner Uma is organising it and says it's not a surprise, but he doesn't know about the band. She said he'd love anything to do with vinyl. He's been hunting for an original pressing of Kind of Blue for ages. Remind me to check the record shop on Broad Street on Wednesday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rohan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "40th", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Friday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "from 7", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Uma", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "love anything to do with vinyl", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "hunting for an original pressing of Kind of Blue", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check the record shop on Broad Street", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t009-013", "text": "Valentina rang. The dinner party she was planning for tomorrow is cancelled because her son has chickenpox. We'll try again in a fortnight.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Valentina", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dinner party", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "son", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "chickenpox", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in a fortnight", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t009-020", "text": "Bao's baby shower is on 9 March at Thomas's house. We're all chipping in for the pram. I need to transfer Thomas £30 by Friday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bao", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "baby shower", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "9 March", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Thomas", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "transfer Thomas £30", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Thomas", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "by Friday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t009-022", "text": "Camila and Emre are getting their son Deniz christened on the 12th of October. They've asked me to be godparent! Must find out what a godparent actually has to do.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Camila", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Emre", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Deniz", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "christened", "owner": "p3", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 12th of October", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "find out what a godparent actually has to do", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t009-025", "text": "Asha and her husband Kwame had their gender reveal yesterday. It's a boy! Their dog Mabel was very confused by the confetti and spent the rest of the afternoon hiding under the table. Asha is due on 19 February, and her mum is flying in from Accra the week before to help. She's already planning the nursery in green and yellow.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Asha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kwame", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "gender reveal", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "boy", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Mabel", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the rest of the afternoon"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Asha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "due", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "19 February", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying in from Accra", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week before", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "planning the nursery in green and yellow", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t009-026", "text": "Irina's leaving do is next Thursday at the Italian place on Queen Street. She retires after 32 years at the library.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Irina", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving do", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Thursday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retires", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "32 years at the library", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}]}
{"id": "t009-027", "text": "Patrick mentioned at the club that he's been dropping hints about a new set of golf irons for his birthday, but his wife Jada thinks he has enough clubs already. His birthday is 28 July. He plays off a twelve handicap and is desperate to get to single figures this season. Maybe a lesson voucher instead.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Patrick", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dropping hints about a new set of golf irons", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jada", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "28 July", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "plays off a twelve handicap", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "desperate to get to single figures", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "this season"}]}
{"id": "t009-028", "text": "Graham has a huge collection of Tottenham programmes going back to the seventies. Keeps them in plastic sleeves in the loft.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Graham", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "huge collection of Tottenham programmes", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the seventies"}]}
{"id": "t009-029", "text": "Don't forget to RSVP to Adriana's engagement party by Monday. It's on Saturday the 18th.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "RSVP to Adriana's engagement party", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Adriana", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "engagement party", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "by Monday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday the 18th", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t009-032", "text": "Caroline loves crossword puzzles and does the Guardian cryptic every day. She's terrible at sudoku though.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Caroline", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "crossword puzzles", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Guardian cryptic", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "every day"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "terrible at sudoku", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t009-033", "text": "Mandla's daughter Zola starts nursery on Monday and he's dreading it more than she is. He's taken the morning off so he can do the drop-off, then he's going straight to the gym to distract himself. His wife Thandi is doing pick-up. He said Zola already has a backpack shaped like a ladybird and refuses to take it off, even at bedtime. Should text Mandla on Monday lunchtime to see how drop-off went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mandla", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zola", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "nursery", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "dreading", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the morning"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Thandi", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zola", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "backpack shaped like a ladybird", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "bedtime"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text Mandla", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mandla", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday lunchtime", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t009-034", "text": "Marcus is into bouldering now. He goes three times a week and has a trip to Fontainebleau planned for May.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Marcus", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "bouldering", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "three times a week"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "trip to Fontainebleau", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "May", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t009-035", "text": "Eilidh's parents are flying over from Inverness on Friday to meet the baby. They're staying a fortnight.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eilidh", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying over from Inverness", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "baby", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t009-038", "text": "Abebe's christening party for baby Liya was lovely. Remember to send Selam the photos I took, and post the card I forgot to give them.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Abebe", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "christening party", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Liya", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send Selam the photos I took", "owner": "p3", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Selam", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "post the card I forgot to give them", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t009-041", "text": "Rohan is vegetarian and doesn't drink. Good to know for the dinner on Saturday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rohan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "vegetarian", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "doesn't drink", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dinner", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t009-046", "text": "Matilda's daughter Rosie has her first ballet recital on Saturday afternoon. Matilda is more nervous than Rosie.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Matilda", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rosie", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first ballet recital", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday afternoon", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Matilda", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rosie", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}]}
{"id": "t009-047", "text": "Jamal and his wife are expecting! Twins, due in late January. He looked shell-shocked. Remind me to check in with him next week once it's sunk in.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jamal", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "expecting", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Twins", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "due", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in late January", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "shell-shocked", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in with him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "once it's sunk in", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t009-049", "text": "Long call with Elijah. His sister Bao is having a tough pregnancy, lots of hospital visits, and their mum has gone down to help. He's worried. Bao's next scan is on Thursday. He also said he's finally got into the Sunday league team he trialled for, which is brilliant. I should message Bao on Thursday evening to see how the scan went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Elijah", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bao", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "tough pregnancy", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "lots of hospital visits", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bao", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "next scan", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got into the Sunday league team", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message Bao", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bao", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday evening", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t009-051", "text": "Camila had to cancel the girls' dinner on Friday because the baby has a cold. Rescheduled to next Friday instead.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Camila", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "girls' dinner", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "baby", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "cold", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "to next Friday", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t009-053", "text": "Florin is hosting a games night on Saturday the 9th. He's really into Gloomhaven at the moment and wants to start a campaign. I should get there early to help set up.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Florin", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "games night", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday the 9th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Gloomhaven", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants to start a campaign", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get there", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "early", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t009-054", "text": "Kiara's baby Amara is being christened on 15 June. Kiara asked if I'd do a reading. I'm nervous about it already.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kiara", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "baby", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Amara", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "christened", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "15 June", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kiara", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t009-057", "text": "Patrick and Jada are having a joint 50th party at the cricket club on 27 September. It's a 70s theme, so I need to find flares.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Patrick", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jada", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "joint 50th party", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "27 September", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "find flares", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t009-058", "text": "Got invited to the Morris family's Christmas drinks on the 20th. Graham said the whole street goes.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Christmas drinks", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 20th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Graham", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t009-059", "text": "Adriana Lopez is now properly into sourdough. She's named her starter Gerald and feeds it twice a day.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Adriana Lopez", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "sourdough", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "starter Gerald", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "twice a day"}]}
{"id": "t009-060", "text": "Mrs Sato from next door had her granddaughter's naming ceremony yesterday. She showed me loads of photos over the fence. I must remember to take her some flowers tomorrow.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mrs Sato", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "next door", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "granddaughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "naming ceremony", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "take her some flowers", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow", "anchor": "a1"}]}
